## Pre-flight checklist (new page or feature)

1. **IA** — canonical nav home and terminology (Guide #3, UI guide)
2. **Archetype** — list/detail/settings/builder/wizard (page architecture)
3. **Workflow** — user goal, steps, error recovery (Guide #2)
4. **API contract** — validation, authz, consent gates (Guides #5, #8, #9)
5. **Data** — timezone storage, locale, retention (Guides #10, #11, #8)
6. **UI states** — loading, empty, error, partial, success
7. **A11y & interaction** — keyboard, focus, semantics (Guides #1, #4)
8. **Visual system** — tokens, not arbitrary CSS (visual design guide)

## Master principle

> Transovo is **one coherent product system**. Every layer — UI, API, backend, jobs — must align with the same standards.
